-- Optional: Mesh grid division count `divs` [S1, unofficial].
-- Optional: Selection voxel position `pos` and size [S5, S6, unofficial].
-- Rendering parameters: Line color, thickness, depth offset [S1, S2, S5, S6, unofficial].
